[00:14.49]1. For those who teach the Word of God,
[00:21.49]There is a joyful share.
[00:28.49]The benefits that we receive
[00:35.49]Are far beyond compare.
[00:43.24]We imitate the Son of God
[00:50.44]And how he taught with love.
[00:57.64]And as we teach, the ones we’re helping
[01:04.84]Draw close to God above.
[01:23.80]2. As teachers of Jehovah’s Word,
[01:30.80]We strive to do what’s right,
[01:37.80]So all may see sincerity
[01:45.28]As we reflect God’s light.
[01:52.32]With diligence we search God’s Word,
[01:59.60]For it has news to tell.
[02:06.75]So we can share our heart’s good treasure
[02:13.75]And teach ourselves as well.
[02:32.64]3. Jehovah gives us all we need
[02:39.64]To teach his precious Word.
[02:46.64]So if we pray to ask for help,
[02:54.14]We know that we’ll be heard.
[03:01.39]We love what’s in the Word of God;
[03:08.49]What’s more, we know it’s true.
[03:15.99]And as we love the ones we’re teaching,
[03:23.29]They’ll soon be teachers too!